    },
    {
      "path": "skills/intrusion/entry-and-spread.md",
      "why": "a method leaf about reconstructing entry, persistence and spread; it names no tool of this pack, and the readers it mentions (`evtx_query`, `auth_log`, `cloudtrail_parse`, `network_log_summary`) belong to other packs and are only mentioned"
    },
    {
      "path": "skills/platforms/nas-storage.md",
      "why": "a method leaf about network storage appliances and their shares, snapshots and replication; the three tools it mentions belong to the virtualization-backup-forensics pack and are only mentioned, if that pack is loaded"
    },
    {
      "path": "skills/recovery/preserve-and-restore.md",
      "why": "a method leaf about the minimum preservation before a rebuild, repair, decryption or reconnection and about acceptance; it works from the ledger and names no tool or program"
    },
    {
      "path": "skills/reporting/for-regulators.md",
      "why": "a notification and reporting method leaf for legal, regulatory and insurance review; it works from the ledger and names no tool or program"
    },
    {
      "path": "skills/reporting/notification-register.md",
      "why": "a notification method leaf for the clocks and the register of duties; it works from the ledger and names no tool or program"
    },
    {
