      "why": "a method leaf about what the survey's and the scan's name withholding hides; it names no tool or program"
    },
    {
      "path": "skills/ransomware/router.md",
      "why": "the pack's router: it names the other notes by the question each answers and holds no rule, tool or program of its own"
    }
